1
00:00:01,524 --> 00:00:04,974
A Metal Cardbot from the Sky!

2
00:00:06,432 --> 00:00:07,996
It's real, I swear!

3
00:00:07,996 --> 00:00:09,789
You may find it hard to believe,

4
00:00:09,789 --> 00:00:12,903
but all of this is really happening!

5
00:00:12,903 --> 00:00:14,653
What is she up to?

6
00:00:14,653 --> 00:00:17,184
Apparently the video of the Metal Cardbots Vera uploaded is getting a ton of views.

7
00:00:17,184 --> 00:00:18,806
Even overseas!

8
00:00:18,806 --> 00:00:20,561
What? Overseas?!

9
00:00:20,561 --> 00:00:23,512
Hrgh! I'm filming a report right now, can't you be quiet?!

10
00:00:23,512 --> 00:00:24,495
Uh, sorry!

11
00:00:25,599 --> 00:00:28,343
What do you mean, it's "getting tons of views overseas"?

12
00:00:28,343 --> 00:00:31,312
I'm saying it already has over 5 million views!

13
00:00:31,312 --> 00:00:32,807
What?!

14
00:00:32,807 --> 00:00:35,215
But it seems the reviews are mixed.

15
00:00:35,853 --> 00:00:37,482
"That's some good CG."

16
00:00:37,482 --> 00:00:39,716
"It's like I'm watching a blockbuster movie."

17
00:00:39,716 --> 00:00:42,155
"Just a copy of another robot anime."

18
00:00:42,155 --> 00:00:44,106
"Is anyone actually falling for this prank?"

19
00:00:44,106 --> 00:00:45,622
I'm so fed up!

20
00:00:45,622 --> 00:00:48,862
How many times do I have to say this is not a fake video!

21
00:00:48,862 --> 00:00:51,253
I have never used any kind of CGI!

22
00:00:51,253 --> 00:00:55,460
Uh, h-hey! Hello?!

23
00:00:55,460 --> 00:00:59,283
It seems she's been getting prank calls and harassment from malicious commenters.

24
00:00:59,283 --> 00:01:01,750
I'm starting to feel bad for her...

25
00:01:01,750 --> 00:01:04,608
Rrgh! Huh?

26
00:01:04,608 --> 00:01:07,522
Who is it this time?

27
00:01:07,522 --> 00:01:11,950
Hello. I am Fleta from Belmeha Island.

28
00:01:11,950 --> 00:01:14,680
I became a fan of yours after seeing your videos.

29
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:17,361
I believe that your videos are real.

30
00:01:17,361 --> 00:01:20,134
I'll be visiting Mowtown tomorrow...

31
00:01:20,533 --> 00:01:22,206
So I'd like to meet up with you and share some information!

32
00:01:22,206 --> 00:01:25,454
Yes! I knew there would be someone out there who believes me!

33
00:01:25,454 --> 00:01:28,875
OMG, I can't wait to meet you, Fleta!

34
00:01:28,875 --> 00:01:30,804
And... I take that back.

35
00:01:30,804 --> 00:01:33,516
She just doesn't give up, does she?

36
00:01:33,516 --> 00:01:35,146
I guess not.

37
00:01:35,926 --> 00:01:38,277
Huh? A friend from overseas?

38
00:01:38,277 --> 00:01:41,310
He said he was a fan of her Metal Cardbot videos.

39
00:01:41,310 --> 00:01:42,615
That doesn't sound good.

40
00:01:42,615 --> 00:01:45,652
I want to keep the Metal Cardbots a secret from as many people as possible.

41
00:01:45,652 --> 00:01:48,882
But guys... everyone here already knows, anyway.

42
00:01:48,882 --> 00:01:53,954
I think Crest is already on to us too.

43
00:01:53,954 --> 00:01:59,350
Why are you chasing people away?!

44
00:02:00,050 --> 00:02:02,778
Now that they've seen them with their own eyes...

45
00:02:02,778 --> 00:02:05,123
I don't think we can keep making up excuses.

46
00:02:05,123 --> 00:02:07,412
Everyone's been letting their guard down...

47
00:02:07,412 --> 00:02:09,289
We need some special training!

48
00:02:11,216 --> 00:02:12,550
Alright!

49
00:02:12,550 --> 00:02:14,372
You're all here to train to either transform into your vehicle mode,

50
00:02:14,372 --> 00:02:16,947
or hide before people see you!

51
00:02:16,947 --> 00:02:18,144
We're ready!

52
00:02:18,457 --> 00:02:22,610
Okay. The moment I turn around, transform or find cover!

53
00:02:23,650 --> 00:02:25,241
1... 2... 3... 4... 5...

54
00:02:25,241 --> 00:02:26,498
6-7-8-9-10!

55
00:02:29,593 --> 00:02:32,954
Dexter... in or out. You have to pick one.

56
00:02:33,331 --> 00:02:35,165
Mega Trucker, I can see you!

57
00:02:35,856 --> 00:02:37,835
You all failed!

58
00:02:39,599 --> 00:02:42,379
But, where did Shadow X go?

59
00:02:42,379 --> 00:02:44,841
You gotta be quick, just like m-

60
00:02:44,841 --> 00:02:45,949
Waah!

61
00:02:47,473 --> 00:02:50,426
You could have just turned your stealth mode on.

62
00:02:50,426 --> 00:02:52,347
You flunked the test too.

63
00:02:59,658 --> 00:03:03,899
First, we need to find out who sent that email to Vera.

64
00:03:03,899 --> 00:03:08,141
Kind of a strange place to... meet a guest from overseas.

65
00:03:08,141 --> 00:03:10,963
Yeah, it's not even a coffee shop. It's a little strange.

66
00:03:13,981 --> 00:03:15,811
Crest?!

67
00:03:16,262 --> 00:03:18,206
What are you guys doing here?

68
00:03:18,949 --> 00:03:20,561
Well... we were...

69
00:03:20,561 --> 00:03:23,170
We are... lost, you see?

70
00:03:23,170 --> 00:03:26,550
The police officer told us to wait here while he calls our parents!

71
00:03:26,550 --> 00:03:28,819
That is the worst lie ever...

72
00:03:28,819 --> 00:03:29,502
Crest!

73
00:03:29,877 --> 00:03:31,693
Fancy seeing you here!

74
00:03:32,383 --> 00:03:33,481
Hello, Vera.

75
00:03:33,481 --> 00:03:35,537
Wow, what a coincidence!

76
00:03:35,537 --> 00:03:37,177
What are you two doing here?

77
00:03:37,177 --> 00:03:38,439
They told me they're lost.

78
00:03:38,439 --> 00:03:41,176
What?! Our school is right around the corner!

79
00:03:41,176 --> 00:03:44,500
Hehe... uh, anyway,

80
00:03:44,500 --> 00:03:46,733
weren't you meeting the fan who sent you that email?

81
00:03:46,733 --> 00:03:48,804
I guess word spreads fast, huh?

82
00:03:48,804 --> 00:03:50,881
Yes. We agreed to meet here.

83
00:03:50,881 --> 00:03:52,000
Here?

84
00:03:54,776 --> 00:03:56,263
Looks like he's here now!

85
00:04:05,628 --> 00:04:07,590
Is he arriving in that?

86
00:04:07,590 --> 00:04:10,252
Careful, Jun! That plane is...

87
00:04:11,820 --> 00:04:13,117
...could it be?

88
00:04:13,117 --> 00:04:14,781
A Metal Cardbot?

89
00:04:17,149 --> 00:04:18,632
Alerting all pedestrians!

90
00:04:18,632 --> 00:04:20,848
Please evacuate the area immediately!

91
00:04:33,557 --> 00:04:34,276
Hm.

92
00:04:34,490 --> 00:04:36,658
A... A robot?

93
00:04:39,889 --> 00:04:42,649
Nice to meet you, Vera.

94
00:04:42,649 --> 00:04:44,869
E-excuse me... how do you know my name?!

95
00:04:44,869 --> 00:04:47,216
My name is Fleta Z.

96
00:04:47,216 --> 00:04:48,629
I am a fan of yours.

97
00:04:48,629 --> 00:04:50,449
Y-You mean...

98
00:04:50,449 --> 00:04:52,757
This is the guy who sent you the email?

99
00:04:52,757 --> 00:04:55,543
The views will be out of this world...

100
00:04:55,543 --> 00:04:56,538
Fleta Z!

101
00:04:58,439 --> 00:05:01,812
Stop doing things that will alarm the people of this planet!

102
00:05:01,812 --> 00:05:04,565
We've been trying to live among them after losing our home!-

103
00:05:04,565 --> 00:05:05,577
B-Blue Cop!

104
00:05:10,504 --> 00:05:14,367
Landing is not permitted in this area. Please evacuate the area immediately.

105
00:05:14,367 --> 00:05:16,737
Does he think he's hiding?

106
00:05:16,737 --> 00:05:19,824
Blue Cop, I'll take your letter of apology later.

107
00:05:21,303 --> 00:05:22,403
Hey, you!

108
00:05:22,403 --> 00:05:23,571
Are you talking to me?

109
00:05:23,571 --> 00:05:25,963
Why did you send Vera that email?

110
00:05:25,963 --> 00:05:27,855
What are you really after?

111
00:05:27,855 --> 00:05:29,680
Your accusations hurt me.

112
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:32,908
Like I said earlier... I am her fan.

113
00:05:32,908 --> 00:05:34,797
She is... my hope and light.

114
00:05:34,797 --> 00:05:35,697
A flute?

115
00:05:35,697 --> 00:05:37,360
How can he play that without a mouth...?

116
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:39,218
It's a long story.

117
00:05:39,218 --> 00:05:41,430
He even talks while playing the flute...

118
00:05:41,978 --> 00:05:43,879
I crash landed on an island called Belmeha

119
00:05:43,879 --> 00:05:47,129
On the opposite end of the Earth.

120
00:05:47,129 --> 00:05:48,372
Where I landed,

121
00:05:48,372 --> 00:05:52,678
I couldn't find any Metal Cardbots nearby.

122
00:05:52,678 --> 00:05:56,542
So I was alone, in the depths of the jungle.

123
00:05:56,542 --> 00:05:59,646
Then, one day... a big turning point arrived.

124
00:05:59,646 --> 00:06:00,894
Turning point?

125
00:06:21,538 --> 00:06:23,310
I was able to find out more about this planet

126
00:06:23,310 --> 00:06:26,589
thanks to the machine they left behind.

127
00:06:26,771 --> 00:06:28,588
...This is?

128
00:06:28,588 --> 00:06:31,326
That's when I found out...

129
00:06:31,326 --> 00:06:33,411
...that I wasn't alone.

130
00:06:33,411 --> 00:06:37,880
That there were other Metal Cardbots that had landed on this planet besides me.

131
00:06:39,675 --> 00:06:43,302
So you thought that you would be able to find your fellow Metal Cardbots through Vera.

132
00:06:43,302 --> 00:06:44,826
Is that right?

133
00:06:44,826 --> 00:06:45,721
Yes.

134
00:06:45,721 --> 00:06:47,408
If that's all, then we'd like to welcome you.

135
00:06:47,408 --> 00:06:48,548
Right, Blue Cop?

136
00:06:48,548 --> 00:06:49,444
Yes.

137
00:06:49,444 --> 00:06:54,375
Let's work together to allow the Metal Cardbots and humans to coexist peacefully.

138
00:06:54,375 --> 00:06:55,692
I refuse.

139
00:06:55,692 --> 00:06:57,369
What do you mean?

140
00:06:57,369 --> 00:07:00,449
I was wondering while watching those videos...

141
00:07:00,449 --> 00:07:03,244
Why do these Metal Cardbots have to live in hiding?

142
00:07:03,244 --> 00:07:04,370
I told you.

143
00:07:04,370 --> 00:07:06,240
For us Metal Cardbots to live peacefully on this planet-

144
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:10,283
We need to have some patience?

145
00:07:10,283 --> 00:07:11,521
I'm not buying it.

146
00:07:11,521 --> 00:07:13,961
Why are we the only ones who have to hide?

147
00:07:13,961 --> 00:07:17,702
What exactly is your point here?

148
00:07:17,702 --> 00:07:21,242
You said you wanted humans and Metal Cardbots to coexist.

149
00:07:21,242 --> 00:07:24,341
So we should be able to show our true selves in public

150
00:07:24,341 --> 00:07:26,829
and not have to live in hiding.

151
00:07:26,829 --> 00:07:28,401
I don't want you to have to hide either...

152
00:07:28,401 --> 00:07:28,880
Jun.

153
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:30,460
But...

154
00:07:30,929 --> 00:07:32,817
We have no choice.

155
00:07:32,817 --> 00:07:35,694
If a giant robot just starts walking around town,

156
00:07:35,694 --> 00:07:37,798
That would send most people flying into panic!

157
00:07:37,798 --> 00:07:40,721
We should be careful about how we do it, and take our time...

158
00:07:40,721 --> 00:07:42,288
So it's you.

159
00:07:42,954 --> 00:07:46,346
The leader of evil that keeps us imprisoned!

160
00:07:46,346 --> 00:07:48,360
W-What do you mean...

161
00:07:51,675 --> 00:07:53,937
Give me the Metal Breath!

162
00:07:53,937 --> 00:07:57,899
If you refuse... then I'll take it by force.

163
00:07:57,899 --> 00:07:59,615
H-hey... hang on!

164
00:07:59,615 --> 00:08:00,591
Beak Arrow!

165
00:08:03,709 --> 00:08:04,781
Blue Cop!

166
00:08:05,478 --> 00:08:07,769
It's just a little scratch. It's nothing, Jun.

167
00:08:07,769 --> 00:08:10,175
You shouldn't put yourself in danger like that! Come back, Blue Cop!

168
00:08:12,622 --> 00:08:14,420
Jun! Let me handle this guy!

169
00:08:14,420 --> 00:08:16,939
Alright. Thank you, Mega Trucker!

170
00:08:17,731 --> 00:08:19,170
Metal Breath, pickup!

171
00:08:20,990 --> 00:08:22,470
Mega Trucker, setup!

172
00:08:25,552 --> 00:08:29,161
Hey, big guy! That was a cowardly move, firing your bow out of nowhere like that!

173
00:08:29,161 --> 00:08:31,358
Hm. I suppose I wasn't being fair.

174
00:08:31,358 --> 00:08:33,342
I'll let you have the first move this time.

175
00:08:33,342 --> 00:08:34,341
What?

176
00:08:35,279 --> 00:08:38,140
Mega Trucker, Mega Power Tackle!

177
00:08:38,950 --> 00:08:41,330
Mega Power Tackle!

178
00:08:46,419 --> 00:08:47,879
Where do you think you're going?

179
00:08:48,316 --> 00:08:50,875
I never said I'd take it sitting down!

180
00:08:51,745 --> 00:08:54,491
Those puny arrows are nothing to me!

181
00:08:54,491 --> 00:08:57,356
If you think that was all, you are sorely mistaken!

182
00:08:58,140 --> 00:09:00,330
I didn't even need to block it!

183
00:09:02,876 --> 00:09:04,726
Mega Trucker, behind you!

184
00:09:04,876 --> 00:09:06,490
Huh? What?

185
00:09:09,831 --> 00:09:11,650
Don't look away, even for a second!

186
00:09:12,542 --> 00:09:13,660
Mega Trucker!

187
00:09:14,221 --> 00:09:15,763
It's dangerous here.

188
00:09:15,763 --> 00:09:18,399
Let's take Vera somewhere safe!

189
00:09:18,399 --> 00:09:21,513
But it looks like the fun has only just begun. I'm staying.

190
00:09:21,513 --> 00:09:23,567
W-What are you saying?!

191
00:09:23,567 --> 00:09:26,716
I want to see it... What Jun is trying to protect.

192
00:09:26,716 --> 00:09:28,586
What he's... protecting?

193
00:09:29,267 --> 00:09:31,870
Shadow X! Spinning Cutter!

194
00:09:32,465 --> 00:09:34,196
Spinning Cutter!

195
00:09:42,692 --> 00:09:44,724
Shadow X, go after him!

196
00:09:44,724 --> 00:09:47,267
If it's an aerial battle, I'm your guy!

197
00:09:51,662 --> 00:09:54,443
Looks like you haven't figured it out yet.

198
00:09:54,443 --> 00:09:58,823
That I'm vastly superior to you in every way. Speed, range, everything!

199
00:09:58,823 --> 00:09:59,774
What was that?

200
00:09:59,774 --> 00:10:01,211
Waah!

201
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:05,208
As well as mobility.

202
00:10:05,758 --> 00:10:07,214
So long.

203
00:10:09,331 --> 00:10:11,572
Shadow X!

204
00:10:11,572 --> 00:10:13,690
Shadow X, are you alright?

205
00:10:13,690 --> 00:10:15,639
I'm going to come get you! Hang in there!

206
00:10:16,299 --> 00:10:17,977
Because of the Metal Breath,

207
00:10:17,977 --> 00:10:20,405
entrusted to the chosen one by the will of the great Deus Machina,

208
00:10:20,405 --> 00:10:27,293
Metal Cardbots will never truly be free.

209
00:10:27,293 --> 00:10:27,989
Now.

210
00:10:27,989 --> 00:10:29,432
Please hand over the Metal Breath.

211
00:10:29,711 --> 00:10:31,172
Let me handle this!

212
00:10:31,172 --> 00:10:32,764
No, I'll do it!

213
00:10:32,764 --> 00:10:38,919
Hold on. You will only become a dart board if you don't have a strategy against those arrows of light.

214
00:10:38,919 --> 00:10:40,654
Right. We have to figure out...

215
00:10:40,654 --> 00:10:42,639
a way to disarm him.

216
00:10:42,639 --> 00:10:43,995
Now, hurry!

217
00:10:44,394 --> 00:10:47,470
I will never... let you have this!

218
00:10:47,470 --> 00:10:48,251
Excuse me?

219
00:10:48,251 --> 00:10:49,543
You heard me!

220
00:10:49,543 --> 00:10:53,258
This is a token of friendship between me and Blue Cop!

221
00:10:53,258 --> 00:10:53,975
Jun...

222
00:10:54,219 --> 00:10:56,480
I see...

223
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,186
How touching!

224
00:10:57,793 --> 00:10:58,434
Hm.

225
00:10:58,679 --> 00:11:01,659
Now I see. So that's what you're trying to protect.

226
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:04,179
Come here, Wild Guardy!

227
00:11:04,326 --> 00:11:05,909
Huh?!

228
00:11:11,910 --> 00:11:13,299
Who are you?!

229
00:11:13,299 --> 00:11:14,187
Wild Guardy?

230
00:11:17,250 --> 00:11:19,528
Buh- Huh- Whuh?-

231
00:11:21,528 --> 00:11:24,342
What the heck is going on here?!

